    },
    {
      "id": "lead",
      "type": "lead",
      "role": "lead",
      "content": "留白不是空出来的地方，而是内容之间用来呼吸、停顿和建立关系的空间。很多人第一次做文章排版时，都会下意识地把页面填满。",
      "importance": 0.78,
      "sourceOrder": 2,
      "sectionId": "entry",
      "relationToPrevious": "new-argument"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "role": "section-heading",
      "content": "01 先判断内容之间是什么关系",
      "importance": 0.85,
      "sourceOrder": 3,
      "sectionId": "section-1",
      "relationToPrevious": "new-section",
      "level": 2,
      "structure": {
        "hasMarker": true,
        "marker": "01",
        "ordinal": 1,
        "title": "先判断内容之间是什么关系"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "body-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "body",
      "content": "调整间距之前，不要急着修改具体数值。你需要先判断，相邻的两个内容究竟是什么关系。",
      "importance": 0.55,
      "sourceOrder": 4,
      "sectionId": "section-1",
      "relationToPrevious": "same-group"
    },
    {
      "id": "callout",
      "type": "callout",
      "role": "explanation",
      "content": "关系越紧密，距离越小；关系越疏远，距离越大。",
      "importance": 0.72,
      "sourceOrder": 5,
      "sectionId": "section-1",
      "relationToPrevious": "turning-point"
    },
    {
      "id": "insight",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "key-insight",
      "content": "排版的稳定感，来自规则的重复，而不是元素的相似。",
      "importance": 0.82,
      "sourceOrder": 6,
      "sectionId": "section-1",
      "relationToPrevious": "before-strong-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "role": "section-heading",
      "content": "02 建立三档基础间距",
      "importance": 0.85,
      "sourceOrder": 7,
      "sectionId": "section-2",
      "relationToPrevious": "new-section",
      "level": 2,
      "structure": {
        "hasMarker": true,
        "marker": "02",
        "ordinal": 2,
        "title": "建立三档基础间距"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "list",
      "type": "list",
      "role": "steps",
      "content": "1. 小间距，用于标题与副标题等紧密关系\n2. 中间距，用于普通段落和连续内容\n3. 大间距，用于章节切换和结尾收束",
      "importance": 0.7,
      "sourceOrder": 8,
      "sectionId": "section-2",
      "relationToPrevious": "same-group",
      "structure": {
        "ordered": true,
        "items": [
          { "ordinal": 1, "content": "小间距，用于标题与副标题等紧密关系" },
          { "ordinal": 2, "content": "中间距，用于普通段落和连续内容" },
          { "ordinal": 3, "content": "大间距，用于章节切换和结尾收束" }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quote",
      "type": "quote",
      "role": "pull-quote",
      "content": "真正高级的留白，不是让页面显得空，而是让读者知道在哪里停下来。",
      "importance": 0.82,
      "sourceOrder": 9,
      "sectionId": "section-2",
      "relationToPrevious": "before-strong-block",
      "structure": {
        "content": "真正高级的留白，不是让页面显得空，而是让读者知道在哪里停下来。",
        "hasAttribution": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ending",
      "type": "ending",
      "role": "conclusion",
      "content": "留白看起来是视觉问题，实际上考验的是对内容结构的理解。",
      "importance": 0.8,
      "sourceOrder": 10,
      "sectionId": "exit",
      "relationToPrevious": "before-ending"
    },
    {
